OL,3,GNEWSABet365 announces plans for 340 job
OL,4,Alosses
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe gambling firm bet365 has announced
OL,7,Fplans to cut 340 staff as part of a
OL,8,Fbusiness restructure.
OL,10,FIt said the jobs would go at its
OL,11,Fheadquarters in Stoke-on-Trent and its
OL,12,Foffices in Malta and Gibraltar.
OL,14,FThe company said it had been "facing a
OL,15,Fhighly competitive trading environment,
OL,16,Fplus increased regulatory and
OL,17,Ftax-related costs" and the moves were
OL,18,Fto "secure the business's long-term
OL,19,Ffuture".
OL,21,FThe job cuts equate to about 3% of its
OL,22,Fworkforce it said.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
